{
  "description": "Shared AnnouncementScheduler vectors (onFix / onElapsedTime). Loaded by the Kotlin and Swift tests. 'config' plus optional 'initial' use the field names of AnnouncementStateData; the state carries across steps and is checked after every step ('expectState', 1e-6 tolerance on doubles). Announcement text uses literal templates so only structured values are compared. Expected values come from an independent Python port, with latitude steps of 0.0027 degrees (~300.2 m).",
